data: {"id": "4d8d5097412542e3-thinking-parallel_evidence-936", "run_id": "4d8d5097412542e3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到关键事实：Pod 状态为 CrashLoopBackOff，退出码 78，应用层日志（crash 前）明确返回 \"CONFIG_MISSING\" (500)，直接指向应用配置缺失导致启动失败。缺口的 Metrics 范围查询因时间参数与实际 Pod 生命周期不匹配返回空，但该维度已由 kubectl_previous_logs 的崩溃前日志替代。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788797615596, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

