data: {"id": "4d8d5097412542e3-final", "run_id": "4d8d5097412542e3", "seq": 941, "ts_ms": 1788797635939, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | CrashLoopBackOff | 应用启动时缺失必要配置（CONFIG_MISSING）导致HTTP请求返回500错误及进程退出码78，进而引发CrashLoopBackOff重启循环。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态 `Running`，Pod 条件 `ContainersNotReady` (status: False) | 确认 Pod 存活但业务容器未就绪 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app` (发生 423 次) | 记录 CrashLoopBackOff 的严重性与持续时间 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器退出原因 `Error`，最后退出码 `exit_code: 78` | 确认为应用层主动退出，非系统级 OOMKilled 或段错误 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 重启计数 `restart_count: 23` | 证实存在反复重启循环，与事件频率对应 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: CrashLoopBackOff) | 独立于 K8s API 验证当前处于等待重启状态 |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 日志聚合：错误消息 `CONFIG_MISSING`，HTTP 状态码 `500`，路径 `/work` (发生 8 次) | 揭示进程退出前最后一次业务操作的直接错误原因 |\n| 7 | Tracing | Deepflow | HTTP Flow 聚合：GET /work 请求持续返回 `response_code: 500` (发生 8 次，172.16.104.27 -> 172.16.104.7) | 证实服务在崩溃前持续向客户端返回业务逻辑错误，非基础设施故障 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n- **编号 3、6、7** 高度互证：日志与 Trace 共同显示在退出前处理了 `GET /work` 并返回 500，错误原因为 `CONFIG_MISSING`；这与容器非零退出码（78）的“应用层逻辑拒绝服务”特征完全一致，排除了网络中断或底层存储故障。\n- **编号 2、4、5** 形成闭环：K8s Event、重启计数与 Prometheus 指标共同锁定了 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，说明应用启动后因上述配置缺失导致崩溃并被系统反复拉起。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用运行时依赖配置缺失 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 业务逻辑返回 HTTP 500 错误 → 进程触发退出码 78 主动终止 → 容器重启陷入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **应用配置缺失（CONFIG_MISSING）**。\n\n1.  **现象支撑**：Pod 呈现 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，容器经历了 23 次重启，并因非零退出码（78）而终止（证据编号 2, 3, 4, 5）。\n2.  **触发机制**：应用启动或运行过程中尝试访问特定配置，因配置缺失导致业务逻辑处理失败，向客户端返回 HTTP 500 错误，并随后以代码 78 退出进程（证据编号 6, 7）。\n3.  **局限性**：当前证据未能捕获完整的启动日志或挂载卷清单，因此无法定位具体缺失的 ConfigMap 名称或缺失的具体配置键值，但配置缺失导致进程异常退出的因果关系已充分确立。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 27.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 64.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 64.4s (Evidence 56.0s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 103.45, "metrics": {"run_id": "4d8d5097412542e3", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 103.45666241645813, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 103456.66241645813, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 78733.57510566711, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 93490.31066894531, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 24372.61986732483}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 27183.905363082886, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 64447.57843017578, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11803.80392074585, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

